START
  ↓
Input Array
  ↓
Call RecursiveBubbleSort(A, n)
  ↓
Is n <= 1?
 ├── YES → RETURN
 ↓ NO
swapped = false
  ↓
i = 0
  ↓
i < n-1?
 ├── NO
 │    ↓
 │  Is swapped == false?
 │    ├── YES → RETURN
 │    ↓ NO
 │  Call RecursiveBubbleSort(A, n-1)
 │
 ↓ YES
A[i] > A[i+1]?
 ├── YES → Swap elements
 │           ↓
 │       swapped = true
 └── NO
       ↓
    i = i + 1
       ↓
   Back to i < n-1?